-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- a loop over messages
-- count messages of 16 bytes in n bytes (count·16 ≤ n): the 8-byte field of message k is at
-- k·16, and its bound k·16 + 8 ≤ n follows from (k+1)·16 ≤ n, which is 16 + k·16 ≤ n by the
-- recursion of times. The offset k·16 is an atom of the linear fragment (variable 0), n variable 1
hyp-m : Hyps
hyp-m = hcons (lc-add (lc-lit #16) (lc-var #0)) (lc-var #1) hnil
